{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/patterns/inject-at-point-of-use","title":"Inject at the point of use","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"inject-at-the-point-of-use","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Inject at the point of use"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This page introduces the first "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"recommended approach"}]},{"t":"text","text":" for structuring a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Craft application. The useful rule is simple:"}]},{"t":"quote","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Get what you need where you need it."}]},{"t":"text","text":""}]}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Declare a dependency in the smallest factory that actually uses it. If a query"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"needs an API method, the query yields that method. If a route guard needs the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"current user, the guard yields the user service. There is no need to add an"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"intermediary method to a component just to forward the call."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-forwarding-shape-to-avoid","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The forwarding shape to avoid"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Even with Craft, do not resolve an API in the component only to forward"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"it into a query:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"Tasks"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftComponent","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Tasks'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", {}, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"api"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"TaskApi","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"tasks"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"query","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'tasks'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"params","kind":"function"},{"text":": () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"true","kind":"keyword"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"loader","kind":"function"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" api.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"list","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  });","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"/* … */","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The loader closes over "},{"t":"code","text":"api"},{"t":"text","text":", so the query itself does not declare the operation"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"it uses. The dependency is attached to the component instead of to the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"smallest factory that performs the request."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"craft-puts-the-dependency-next-to-the-work","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Craft puts the dependency next to the work"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"With Craft, the component declares the query directly, and the query yields"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"exactly the API operation it needs. In this example, "},{"t":"code","text":"TaskApi"},{"t":"text","text":" is a crafted"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"service (or a small boundary adapter):"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  craftComponent,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  forNode,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ifNode,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  li,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  p,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ul,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"} ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/component'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { query } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/core'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"Tasks"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftComponent","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Tasks'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", {}, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"tasks"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"query","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'tasks'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"params","kind":"function"},{"text":": () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"true","kind":"keyword"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"loader","kind":"function"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" TaskApi.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"list","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  });","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"ifNode","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    tasks.isLoading,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"p","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'Loading…'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"ul","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        "},{"text":"forNode","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" tasks.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"value","kind":"function"},{"text":"() ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"??","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" [],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"track","kind":"function"},{"text":": (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"task"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" task.id },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"task"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"li","kind":"function"},{"text":"(task.title),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        ),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      ),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  );","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"TaskApi.list()"},{"t":"text","text":" is yielded directly from the "},{"t":"code","text":"query"},{"t":"text","text":" loader. The query owns the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"server state, while the template owns only the rendering of that state. There"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"is no "},{"t":"code","text":"loadTasks()"},{"t":"text","text":" method, no subscription, and no extra service whose only"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"job is to forward this request."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"why-this-is-useful","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Why this is useful"}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"the-dependency-graph-is-explicit","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The dependency graph is explicit"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"yield* TaskApi.list()"},{"t":"text","text":" is part of the loader's dependency type. Craft can use"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the same information for route DI checks, test registers, and dependency"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"snapshots. A missing provider or mock is found at the boundary where it matters."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"dependencies-stay-granular","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Dependencies stay granular"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"When a consumer needs one operation, yield that operation instead of the whole"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"service:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"list"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" TaskApi.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"list","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The graph records the property that was used. Tests only need to provide"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"list"},{"t":"text","text":", and future changes to unrelated API methods do not expand this"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"consumer's contract."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"async-behaviour-has-one-owner","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Async behaviour has one owner"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"query"},{"t":"text","text":" derives the loading, value, and exception state. The component does not"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"need a second signal, subscription, or manual error flag that could drift away"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"from the request."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-rule-of-thumb","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The rule of thumb"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"If a query or mutation needs an API operation, yield it in that query or"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"mutation."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"If a service needs another service, yield the dependency in that service's"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"factory."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"If a component needs a dependency directly, yield it in the component's"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"factory."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Create a dedicated service when it owns reusable behaviour or a meaningful"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"boundary — not merely to forward one method call."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Direct does not mean unstructured. The dependency is still named, tracked,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"scoped, mockable, and exposed through a deliberate public API. It simply lives"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"close to the code that uses it."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"see-also","children":[{"t":"text","text":"See also"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/concepts/mental-model","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"The mental model"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — declare, yield, derive"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/app/craft-service","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"craftService"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — define and compose services"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/app/expose-api","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Shaping a service's public API"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — expose only what a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"consumer needs"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/testing/services","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Testing services"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — test the same dependency graph"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/testing/architecture","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Architecture rules"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — constraints across that graph"}]}]]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"the-forwarding-shape-to-avoid","text":"The forwarding shape to avoid"},{"level":2,"id":"craft-puts-the-dependency-next-to-the-work","text":"Craft puts the dependency next to the work"},{"level":2,"id":"why-this-is-useful","text":"Why this is useful"},{"level":3,"id":"the-dependency-graph-is-explicit","text":"The dependency graph is explicit"},{"level":3,"id":"dependencies-stay-granular","text":"Dependencies stay granular"},{"level":3,"id":"async-behaviour-has-one-owner","text":"Async behaviour has one owner"},{"level":2,"id":"the-rule-of-thumb","text":"The rule of thumb"},{"level":2,"id":"see-also","text":"See also"}]}